{
  "name": "fairdrive-policy-adjustments",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Fairdrive Policy Adjustments: lists policy and goodwill adjustments with no approver, self-approved, over the approval limit, with no reason or repeated on the same vehicle, and totals them by advisor and reason. Never posts an adjustment.",
